ssional road racing, off-road racing and bass fishing.\n\nYou can choose from five different experiences featuring OPTIMA PowerPro Ambassadors: James Clay, Edwin Evers, Lucas Murphy, Corry Weller, and Mark Stielow.\n\nDon\u2019t forget to listen to a handful of inspiring of stories from battery owners, who put their power source to the test, in the Wall of Power gallery.", "short_description": "Experience OPTIMA Batteries in Virtual Reality! Travel through time in a 3D exploration of OPTIMA's rich history. Or ride along with a PowerPro Ambassador for in-vehicle action like you've never experienced."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.optimabatteries.com/en-us/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.optimabatteries.com/en-us/terms-and-conditions", "publisher_name": "Vaylian", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.optimabatteries.com/en-us", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ACTION", "ADVENTURE", "RACING", "SPORTS", "NARRATIVE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US"], "supported_input_devices": [], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1231747280649665"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12138933_1797878073826199_1460348176958488576_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f2edWEZlM6MQ7kNvwFB0yFn&_nc_oc=Adm6QyjDqTZCQ_ZE_qbm_XWP83urMJH2uk6YVXTw8v6t1mNYBf_YuUJrGfNnK3BUzmg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuxen_lSzvWlYJeoVde_aA-f7IoEI9-iGMFVB5Ts7Ay3g&oe=69A43EBB"}, "is_concept": false, "is